#21000
The Shore of the Black Sea~
   The tunnel opens onto a beach of black sand at the edge of an underground
sea. The cavern above is so vast that its roof is lost in darkness, and the
water stretches away into the dark, still and black as oil. Pale lights
glimmer far out beneath the surface, in the shape of streets.
